---
const { type } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['project-art', type]} aria-hidden="true">
{type === 'relevo' && <div class="relevo-workspace">
  <div class="relevo-intro"><span class="relevo-wordmark">Relevo<span></span></span><h4>A worker stops.<br/>The work stays.</h4><p>Durable tasks. Explicit ownership.<br/>A history you can inspect.</p><span class="art-label">ILLUSTRATIVE RECOVERY FLOW</span></div>
  <div class="relevo-flow"><div class="relevo-flow-header"><span>One job. Every attempt.</span><span>PostgreSQL</span></div><ol><li><span class="relevo-node"></span><div><b>Task committed</b><span>Saved before acceptance</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></li><li><span class="relevo-node"></span><div><b>Worker lease expires</b><span>Attempt preserved in history</span></div><span class="relevo-event">Recorded</span></li><li><span class="relevo-node"></span><div><b>Another attempt can begin</b><span>Backoff + remaining retry budget</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></li></ol><div class="relevo-flow-footer"><span>Renewable leases</span><span>Fencing tokens</span><span>Bounded retries</span></div></div>
</div>}
{type === 'loganalyzer' && <div class="log-workspace">
  <div class="art-toolbar"><span class="art-brand">LogAnalyzer</span><span>Illustrative incident view</span><i></i></div>
  <div class="log-body"><div class="log-side"><span class="art-label">SERVICES</span><b><i></i> api-gateway</b><b><i></i> auth-service</b><b><i></i> worker</b><span class="log-side-bottom">3 sources<br/>One connected story.</span></div>
  <div class="log-main"><h4>Follow the evidence.</h4><div class="log-lines"><span><time>14:02:01</time> Gateway received request</span><span><time>14:02:03</time> Auth connection timed out</span><span><time>14:02:04</time> Worker retry scheduled</span></div><div class="reasoning"><span class="reason-dot"></span><div><strong>Connected, not isolated.</strong><p>Parse → retrieve → reason</p></div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m8 5 7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div></div></div>
</div>}
{type === 'mindarc' && <div class="mind-workspace">
  <div class="art-toolbar"><span class="art-brand">MindArc<span class="brand-spark">✳</span></span><span>Illustrative learning flow</span></div>
  <div class="mind-body"><h4>A little practice.<br/>A clearer understanding.</h4><div class="lesson"><span class="lesson-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M7 5h13l5 5v17H7V5Z M20 5v6h5 M11 16h10 M11 21h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span><div><b>From material to questions</b><span>Generate · review · practice</span></div><span class="lesson-arrow">→</span></div><div class="mind-bottom"><span>01 / LEARN</span><span>02 / PRACTICE</span><span>03 / REFLECT</span></div></div>
</div>}
{type === 'rate-limiter' && <div class="rate-workspace"><div class="rate-intro"><h4>Long URL.<br/>Short story.</h4><div class="url-transform"><span>https://example.com/a/very/long/path</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3v17m-6-6 6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg><b>go / k7Bx2</b></div></div><div class="window-demo"><div class="window-top"><span>Sliding window</span><b>60 sec</b></div><div class="request-bars">{Array.from({length:15},(_,i)=><i style={`--i:${i};height:${30+(i*17)%60}%`}/>)}</div><div class="window-axis"><span>Older requests</span><span>Now</span></div><p>Limits follow the window.<br/>State survives the restart.</p><span class="art-label">CONCEPTUAL SYSTEM VIEW</span></div></div>}
</div>
